# ? Env files (build-time envs are passed as a BuildKit secret, never through the context)
**/.env*
**/*.local

# ? Docker related files
**/.dockerignore
**/dockerfile
**/dockerfile.dockerignore
**/docker-compose*.yml

# ? Artefacts (regenerated inside the build)
**/node_modules
# ? Only the build folder of an app (the artifacts): a source folder can be named `build` too
apps/*/build
workers/*/build
**/dist
**/out
**/.turbo
**/.tanstack
**/*generated*
apps/web/src/gen
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# ? Other apps' heavy folders (their package.json files are still needed by turbo prune)
apps/mobile/android
apps/mobile/ios
apps/mobile/.expo

# ? VCS, CI and IDE
**/.git
**/.github
**/.devcontainer
**/.vscode
**/.zed
**/.idea
**/.DS_Store

# ? docs
**/README.md
**/*.mdx
**/*.stories.*

# ? logs and reports
**/logs
**/*.log

# ? Models
**/*.onnx
